# 32. Trade-Offs

## Pandas Advantages

* Easy tabular manipulation
* Powerful grouping/aggregation
* Excellent data-cleaning functionality
* Integrates well with NumPy and ML libraries
* Excellent for exploratory analysis

## Limitations

Pandas isn't designed to be the universal solution for:

* Massive distributed datasets
* GPU-first tensor computation
* Deep-learning training

For very large data, you may eventually use:

```text
Spark
Polars
Dask
SQL
BigQuery
DuckDB
```

And for deep learning:

```text
PyTorch
TensorFlow
```

